ard foundation" data-copy="A focused project workspace for plans and connected task outputs."><strong>Dashboard foundation</strong><small>Plan · Active</small></button><button class="record" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-type="TK" data-title="Build artifact reader" data-copy="Open rich HTML outputs in a secure, resizable focus surface."><strong>Build artifact reader</strong><small>Task · In progress</small></button><button class="record" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-type="TK" data-title="Verify mobile journey" data-copy="Keep navigation and details readable on a 390px viewport."><strong>Verify mobile journey</strong><small>Task · Ready</small></button></aside><section class="content"><article class="article" data-ui="card"><span class="code" id="reader-code">PL</span><h2 id="reader-title">Dashboard foundation</h2><p class="lede" id="reader-copy">A focused project workspace for plans and connected task outputs.</p><div class="properties"><div>Status</div><div>Active</div><div>Project</div><div>Dashboard Preview</div><div>Updated</div><div>Today at 14:32</div></div><p class="body-copy">The artifact reader preserves hierarchy while giving long-form content enough room to breathe. Tasks remain directly reachable and every visual output opens at a useful inspection size.</p><section class="hierarchy"><strong>Plan hierarchy</strong><button class="task" type="button" data-title="Build artifact reader" data-copy="Open rich HTML outputs in a secure, resizable focus surface."><span>↳ Build artifact reader</span><span>In progress</span></button><button class="task" type="button" data-title="Verify mobile journey" data-copy="Keep navigation and details readable on a 390px viewport."><span>↳ Verify mobile journey</span><span>Ready</span></button></section><section class="outputs" aria-label="Task outputs"><button class="output" type="button" data-output="Desktop workbench"><span class="output-code">WF</span><br><strong>Desktop workbench</strong><br><small>Interactive wireframe</small></button><button class="output" type="button" data-output="Warm neutral palette"><span class="output-code">AS</span><br><strong>Warm neutral palette</strong><br><small>Color asset</small></button><button class="output" type="button" data-output="Applied dashboard"><span class="output-code">DS</span><br><strong>Applied dashboard</strong><br><small>Production design</small></button></section></article></section></section><aside class="preview" id="design-preview" aria-label="Output focus preview"><div class="handle"></div><header class="preview-top"><div><small>OUTPUT PREVIEW</small><strong id="design-preview-title">Desktop workbench</strong></div><button class="quiet" id="design-preview-close" type="button">Close</button></header><div class="preview-canvas"><div class="screen"><h2>Rendered screen</h2><div class="screen-grid"><div class="screen-side"></div><div class="screen-main"></div></div></div></div></aside></main><script>function showRecord(type,title,copy){document.getElementById("reader-code").textContent=type;document.getElementById("reader-title").textContent=title;document.getElementById("reader-copy").textContent=copy}document.querySelectorAll(".record").forEach(function(button){button.addEventListener("click",function(){document.querySelectorAll(".record").forEach(function(item){item.setAttribute("aria-pressed","false")});button.setAttribute("aria-pressed","true");showRecord(button.dataset.type,button.dataset.title,button.dataset.copy)})});document.querySelectorAll(".task").forEach(function(button){button.addEventListener("click",function(){showRecord("TK",button.dataset.title,button.dataset.copy)})});document.querySelectorAll(".output").forEach(function(button){button.addEventListener("click",function(){document.getElementById("design-preview-title").textContent=button.dataset.output;document.getElementById("design-preview").classList.add("open")})});function closeDesignPreview(){document.getElementById("design-preview").classList.remove("open")}document.getElementById("design-preview-close").addEventListener("click",closeDesignPreview);document.addEventListener("keydown",function(event){if(event.key==="Escape")closeDesignPreview()});</script></body></html>' WHERE "id" = 2 AND "projectId" = 1 AND "title" = 'Artifact Reader — Focus Mode';

